gsp-r10-adapter
https://github.com/mholow/gsp-r10-adapter

The Garmin Approach R10 Bluetooth support (src/GrimesGolf.Core/Garmin, src/GrimesGolf.Bluetooth/R10BleLink.cs) is
ported from gsp-r10-adapter's direct Bluetooth mode: its GATT identifiers, MultiLink handshake bytes, GFDI
acknowledgement layout, the order of its set-up requests, and its LaunchMonitor.proto schema.

